    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a66417f83bc1b99159d2b850",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "统治地位果然是个难对付的赛马娘……。\n但她的话也许不全错，不对，应该是完全没错——",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e58d936640badfb3066740faddfceb529f9f9d86104ee348b7852c94e8a1476",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1145/storytimeline_041145007.json",
      "json_path": [
