    {
      "uid": "zhcn:962bca930d0cae6678d4cf60",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那么，作战会议就到此为止。我们已经达成共识了。\n你也是……想见我的时候不用客气，直接说出来就好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fafb8b60eca6d5b51c796ae29abba3e0b630c98f5f42ecee40b9a88203f5f3e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1145/storytimeline_041145007.json",
      "json_path": [
